  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat the oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Trim the green tops from the baby carrots and scrub the carrots clean. Cut the beetroot into small chunks. Cut the red onion into wedges.\n• Place the veggies on a lined oven tray, sprinkle with the dukkah and drizzle with olive oil. Toss to coat. Spread out evenly and roast until tender, 20-25 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/60d0438aa6a86c7cc137b26c/step-245be099.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the veggies are roasting, pat the haloumi dry with a paper towel and cut into 1cm slices.\n• Finely chop the garlic. Roughly chop the baby spinach leaves.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/60d0438aa6a86c7cc137b26c/step-4d15309b.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a medium saucepan, melt the butter over a medium-high heat. Add the garlic and chermoula spice blend (see ingredients) and cook until fragrant, 1 minute. Add the water and the vegetable stock powder and bring to the boil. Add the couscous and stir to combine. Cover with a lid and remove from the heat. Set aside until all the water is absorbed, 5 minutes. Fluff up with a fork.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/60d0438aa6a86c7cc137b26c/step-da78ae67.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over a medium-high heat. Add the haloumi and cook until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/60d0438aa6a86c7cc137b26c/step-04904241.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "When the couscous is finished, stir through the spinach.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/60d0438aa6a86c7cc137b26c/step-6ea6adc4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide the spiced couscous between plates.\n• Top with the roasted baby carrots, veggies and haloumi slices. Drizzle over the golden goddess dressing.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/60d0438aa6a86c7cc137b26c/step-603399d0.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
